      "description": "All mutating routes require a Bearer access token (collection-level auth). Money-moving routes (contribute/payout/refund) additionally require an Idempotency-Key header — pre-filled with Postman's {{$guid}} dynamic variable so retries within the same send get a fresh key; re-send the exact same request twice manually if you want to test idempotency (Postman won't reuse the guid across sends)."
